   "value": "an epoch is floor(N_live / 32) full batches over a fresh permutation of the TRAIN live frames (tail dropped). Real-spoof and synthetic pools are consumed sequentially from their own permutations without replacement; when fewer items remain than a batch needs, the remainder is discarded and the next permutation is drawn (never duplicates inside a batch). Batch tensor order: live, real spoof, synthetic. E00 uses 32 live + 32 real spoof"
